  step,dige:51f8eda66156a011
  step=2,desc:stand a warm pond and a cold pond — each an A with the toy’s code — and one tank in each with no code of its own — turn one,dige:1efd136ec2845a0a
  step=3,desc:turn both tanks to turn 13 — each asks its pond for the weather,dige:f39cbe6a7ab90405
    Assertion:a-tank-is-served,sentence:a tank is served the weather of the pond it stands in — the warm pond’s fish lay and the cold pond’s never do
  step=4,desc:read the code rows — the ponds’ and the tanks’,dige:f39cbe6a7ab90405
    Assertion:a-tank-with-no,sentence:a tank with no code of its own runs its pond’s — its chain digest is its pond’s one link down
  step=5,desc:push the twins version to the warm pond alone — it waits for Story,dige:6f1d09e2d452aa20
    Assertion:a-version-pushed-to,sentence:a version pushed to a pond waits on the pond until Story lets it through
  step=6,desc:Story lets the push through at the seam — both tanks turn to turn 19,dige:db79054b0c92148b
